to fill the plotting region without preserving the geographic aspect ratio.

Cluster colors follow the column order of \code{ancestry_matrix}. If
\code{legend.cluster.names = NULL}, sequential cluster names are generated.

The positions supplied through \code{north.arrow.position} and \code{scale.position}
